   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CREPA - WSA   Reg Centre Water Sanit West Central Africa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CREPA - WSA Reg Vatten sanitet V&#xe4;st- och Centralafrika</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad tillg&#xe5;ng till dricksvatten och sanitet f&#xf6;r     fattiga m&#xe4;nniskor i v&#xe4;st- och centralafrika. 17 l&#xe4;nder t&#xe4;cks av       CREPA, vars huvudkontor ligger i Ouagadougou. Samfinansiering         (&quot;basket fund&quot;) tillsammans med DDC/Schweiz.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for improved water supply, sanitation and hygiene education  for the poor in West and Central Africa. 17 countries are covered by CREPA, whose regional head office is located in Ouagadougou.          Co-funding in a basket arrangement with DDC/Switzerland.</narrative>
